			<h1>About</h1>
			<p>I'm Chirag — a Product Manager and builder. I work at the intersection of product thinking and hands-on engineering: I run multi-agent pipelines, build crawlers, dashboards, and tools, and I care about shipping things people can actually use.</p>
			<p>My style: build small, ship publicly, iterate. This site is the standing example — every project here reached a state a stranger could open and try.</p>
			<p>Currently based in Luxembourg. Also learning Luxembourgish, which has spawned a few projects of its own.</p>
